{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04334","headline":"哭故人 · 乔知之","name":"哭故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生死久离居，凄凉历旧庐。\n叹兹三径断，不践十年余。\n古木巢禽合，荒庭爱客疎。\n匣留弹罢劒，牀积读残书。\n玉没终无像，兰言强问虚。\n平生不得意，泉路复何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔知之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}